spell OnlyOnePassage ⟪veil ⟡ Cabal coven⟫ ⟮veil.Hallowed⟯
    ⟪warp ⟡ coven ↝⊛ circle⟫ ⟪veilWard ⟡ veil ⋜ warp.silence⟫ ⟪weft ⟡ coven ⧸ veil ↝⊛ circle⟫
